ty lines are ignored.\r\n    Any commented lines become uncommented.\r\n    Any uncommented lines become commented.\r\n\r\nInline comment Toggle now acts as a true toggle.\r\n\r\nAdded comment folding support\r\n\r\n    Indented comments can now be folded.\r\n\r\nAdded paste_selected to TextEdit, made it default to true in the editor.\r\n\r\n    TextEdit now has the possibility to paste selected, whatever contents are pasted will become selected automatically.\r\n    CodeEditor has that enabled by default.\r\n\r\nFixed indentation on empty lines\r\n\r\n    Empty lines are now indented right with the rest of the code instead of being ignored.\r\n\r\nFixed nested line folding in TextEdit\r\n\r\n    When unfolding lines, child folded lines do not get unfolded with it anymore.\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-23T17:13:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T08:53:23Z","closed_at":"2026-07-24T00:48:24Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"569ce4ea5a92d11131f43b5141515b7036c93db6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"sabudum:Code-Editor-Improvements","ref":"Code-Editor-Improvements","repo":{"id":1302847344,"node_id":"R_kgDOTaffcA","name":"godot","full_name":"sabudum/godot","owner":{"login":"sabudum","id":19273825,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjczODI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19273825?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sabudum","html_url":"https://github.com/sabudum","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sabudum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sabudum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sabudum/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github